t":"As shown in Figure 3, on MNIST, ViT-S is 51.1 points better than ResNet-18.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s12","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"As shown in Figure 3, on AG News, MLP is 22.3 points better than ResNet-18.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s13","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"On IMDB, Ours obtains a test accuracy of 72.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s14","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"Figure 4 shows the training loss.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s15","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"At epoch 8, the loss of EfficientNet is 0.541.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s16","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"As shown in Figure 4, at epoch 3, the loss of Baseline is 1.577.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s17","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"As shown in Figure 4, at epoch 1, the loss of EfficientNet is 1.961.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s18","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"As shown in Figure 4, Baseline has a loss of 0.685 at epoch 3.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s19","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"On SST-2, SVM obtains an accuracy of 73.0%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_008_s20","report_id":"holdout_008","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}